    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "BROE auctioneers are delighted to present this well-proportioned two-bedroom first-floor apartment, ideally situated in the popular Whitehall Square development on Whitehall Road West, Dublin 12. This attractive property offers an excellent opportunity for first-time buyers, people downsizing, or investors seeking a conveniently located apartment with easy access to Dublin City Centre and a host of local amenities. The accommodation briefly comprises an entrance hallway, a bright and spacious living room, a separate kitchen, two well-proportioned bedrooms, and a main bathroom. The apartment is situated on the first floor and provides comfortable and practical living accommodation. Whitehall Square is ideally positioned close to a wide range of amenities, including local shops, cafés, restaurants, schools, parks and recreational facilities. The property also benefits from excellent transport links, with regular bus services providing easy access to Dublin City Centre and surrounding areas. The M50 and Dublin Airport are also within convenient reach. Whether you are looking to take your first step onto the property ladder, acquire a well-located city apartment, or add to an investment portfolio, this property is sure to appeal.\r\n\r\nTo express your interest, please contact Shauna O’Brien at BROE auctioneers."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hall\t\t         3.00m x 1.69m \tTo include wood flooring, storage and an alarm panel.  \r\n\t\t\t\t\t\r\n\r\nKitchen\t\t\t         2.60m x 1.72m\tShaker style kitchen to include all appliances. \r\n\r\n\r\nLounge\t\t\t         5.42m x 4.24m\tThe lounge area is bright and spacious, filled with natural light and featuring beautiful wood flooring.\r\n\r\n\r\n(1) Bedroom\t\t\t2.50m x 4.13m \tTo include wood flooring and built in wardrobes.  \r\n\r\n\r\n(2) Bedroom\t\t\t2.92m x 3.26m \tTo include wood flooring and built in wardrobes. Double doors onto balcony. \r\n\r\n\r\nBathroom\t\t\t1.71m x 2.20m \tPartly tiled bathroom to include WHB, WC and Bath."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "•\t1st-floor apartment. \r\n•\tDouble glazed windows. \r\n•\tBER C.\r\n•\tAlarmed. \r\n•\tNo onward chain. \r\n•\tManagement fees € 1927.76\r\n•\tNo rent cap. \r\n•\tc.55 mtrs sq. \r\n•\tExcellent location.\r\n•\tEarly viewing highly recommended."
